@startuml
title <size:20><b>VoxFlow - Speech Session Streaming Sequence</b></size>\n<size:12>ESP32 Producer-Consumer Streaming, VXF1 Protocol & REST Ingestion</size>

hide footbox

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 170

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #475569
    LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC

    ParticipantBorderColor #334155
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
    ParticipantFontStyle bold

    ActorBorderColor #334155
    ActorBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
    ActorFontColor #0F172A
    ActorFontStyle bold
}

skinparam participant {
    FontSize 11
}

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "User" as User #DBEAFE
participant "ESP32 Controller" as ESP #BFDBFE
participant "INMP441 Mic" as Mic #DBEAFE
participant "I2S Capture Task\n(Producer)" as Producer #BFDBFE
queue "Ring Buffer\n(FreeRTOS Queue)" as Queue #EDE9FE
participant "Python Serial Bridge\n(tools/esp32_serial_bridge.py)" as Bridge #EDE9FE
participant "Flask REST API" as API #E0F2FE

== 1. Initialization & Handshake ==

Bridge -> ESP : PING\n(USB Serial / 460800 baud)
ESP --> Bridge : PONG

Bridge -> API : POST /api/v1/session/start
API --> Bridge : 201 Created (session_id)

== 2. Streaming Capture Initiation ==

alt Physical-Buttons Mode (--physical-buttons)
    User -> ESP : Press START Button (GPIO27)
else Serial-Start Mode (Default)
    Bridge -> ESP : START command
end

ESP -> ESP : Status LED ON (GPIO4 HIGH)
ESP -> Bridge : Header: RECORDING\nSAMPLE_RATE=16000\nFORMAT=PCM_S16LE_MONO\nSTREAM=VXF1\nDATA_START
ESP -> Producer : Notify / Start capture task

== 3. Continuous Real-Time Streaming (VXF1 Framing) ==

loop Continuous Audio Streaming (up to 60.0s / 960,000 samples)
    Producer -> Mic : Read I2S DMA (1024 samples / 64ms)
    Mic --> Producer : 24-bit raw I2S data
    Producer -> Producer : Convert to 16-bit PCM (clamped)
    Producer -> Queue : Enqueue AudioFrame (2048 bytes)

    ESP -> Queue : Dequeue AudioFrame
    ESP -> ESP : Compute IEEE 802.3 CRC32
    ESP -> Bridge : VXF1 Frame [Magic: "VXF1" | Seq: N | Len: 2048 | CRC32 | Payload]
    Bridge -> Bridge : Validate Seq == expected & CRC32 match\nAppend PCM payload to session stream
end

alt User Terminated
    User -> ESP : Press STOP Button (GPIO33)
else Auto Timeout / Hard Limit
    ESP -> ESP : 60-second limit reached (960,000 samples)
end

== 4. Stream Termination & WAV Reconstruction ==

ESP -> Queue : Drain & transmit any remaining queued frames
ESP -> Bridge : Zero-length Frame [Magic: "VXF1" | Seq: N_final | Len: 0 | CRC32: 0]
ESP -> Bridge : DONE marker
ESP -> ESP : Status LED OFF (GPIO4 LOW)

Bridge -> Bridge : Assemble ONE continuous WAV (16 kHz, 16-bit mono)

== 5. API Ingestion & Inference Lifecycle ==

Bridge -> API : POST /api/v1/session/<session_id>/audio (multipart WAV)
API --> Bridge : 200 OK (Audio uploaded)

Bridge -> API : POST /api/v1/session/<session_id>/stop
API --> Bridge : 200 OK (Session stopped)

Bridge -> API : POST /api/v1/session/<session_id>/analyze
API --> Bridge : 200 OK (Analysis complete)

@enduml